{"id":"gewollt","lemma":"gewollt","pos":"adj","rank":2090,"glosses":["deliberate; intentional; intended","contrived; unnatural; awkward; cheesy"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈvɔlt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c2/De-gewollt.ogg/De-gewollt.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"gewollter","superlative":"am gewolltesten"},"examples":[{"text":"Hast du das nicht immer gewollt?","en":"Isn't that what you always wanted?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"at all times without…"},null]},{"text":"Es war nicht, was wir gewollt hatten.","en":"It wasn't what we wanted.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"we"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Das habe ich aber nicht gewollt.","en":"This isn't what I wanted.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Sie sagten, der Präsident habe genau das gewollt.","en":"They said it was exactly what the president wanted.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"president"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"just, exactly"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe nie gewollt, dass all dies geschieht.","en":"I never wanted all this to happen.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"never, never at all"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"all"},null,{"g":"to occur","l":"geschehen"}]}]}